Callee protect functions: 
  Ryaml_has_class

Callee safe functions (non-trivially, excluding callee-protect): 
  Ryaml_collapse
  Ryaml_deparse_function
  Ryaml_get_classes
  Ryaml_inspect
  Ryaml_run_handler
  emit_char
  emit_nil
  emit_string
  handle_alias

Mixed callee-protect/callee-safe functions [ callee-[S]afe callee-[P]rotect caller-protect[!] non-SEXP[-] ]: 
  Ryaml_serialize_to_yaml !S!!!!!!!
  Ryaml_unserialize_from_yaml !!!S!!S!
  find_map_entry S!-
  handle_map -S-!---
  handle_sequence -S-!-
  possibly_record_alias !-P

